OL,5,G0300 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FElgin to Loch Ness: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo visits Lossiemouth and
OL,8,     FInverness. His journey ends at
OL,9,     FLoch Ness, where he joins a Deep
OL,10,     FScan research team searching for
OL,11,     Fthe elusive monster.
OL,12,G0325 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FSt Ives to St Day: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo explores the West Country
OL,15,     Fbetween the wars, setting off from
OL,16,     Fthe Cornish seaside resort of St
OL,17,     FIves and ending in the former
OL,18,     Fmining village of St Day.
